*************************************** Business Discovery
- understand their pain point, and define what success looks like

clarify three core things:
    The Goal: What business decision will this data help them make?
    The Data Source: Where does this data live today (e.g., Excel sheets, CRM, app logs)?
    The Rules: What are the business logic and definitions (e.g., "What exactly defines an 'active customer' or a 'completed order'?")?


